<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT sets cash div on select preferred shrs.</title>
<headline>PLDT sets cash div on select preferred shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co Inc said on Friday its board had approved a 50 centavo cash dividend on its convertible preferred shares series A, I, R W.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on August 29 for stockholders as of July 25. It covers the semi-annual period ending July 31.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date is on July 16.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
